Architecture of loading Product data

        GET /products/1
                │
                ▼
        get_product_service()
                │
                ├───────────────┐
                ▼               ▼
            get_db()      get_redis_service()
                │               │
                ▼               ▼
         AsyncSession      RedisService
                │               │
                └───────┬───────┘
                        ▼
                 ProductService
                        │
                ┌───────┴────────┐
                ▼                ▼
         ProductDbInterface   RedisService
                │                │
                ▼                ▼
              SQLite            Redis

Architecture of saving Product Data

                        Router (products_router)
                           │
                           ▼
                 create_product service
                    /             \
                   /               \
                  ▼                 ▼
              get_db()         get_redis()
                 │                  │
                 ▼                  ▼
            AsyncSession          RedisService
                 │                  │
                 └────────┬─────────┘
                          ▼
                   ProductService